# Assets

Read [docs/assets/README.md](../../docs/assets/README.md).

- Icons: `Assets.icons.<camelCase>` from `lib/core/resources/gen/assets.gen.dart`.
- Never string-literal `assets/icons/...` in `lib/` (except codegen config).
- Regenerate: `fvm dart run flutter_gen:flutter_gen_command` after asset changes.
- Do not map icons to product screens until owner approves (CSV is rename audit only).
